  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "SylReg",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset for SylReg\n\t\n\nThis repository contains the datasets and alignments associated with the paper Speaker-Disentangled Chunk-Wise Regression for Syllabic Tokenization.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Details\n\t\n\n\nLanguage: English\nLicense: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0\nRepository: GitHub Code\nPaper: arXiv:2607.04064\nDemo / Project Page: Project Page\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSample Usage\n\t\n\nBelow is an example of syllabic tokenization for speech language models using the trained models from the corresponding code\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ryota-komatsu/SylReg.",
